From aa5bd69de352e0e72b461c161d1059cf88e0bac7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:38:59 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Quick Add

The universal block form's type picker replaces it. Removes the Quick
Add button partial and its includes, the Settings tab, the
update_quick_add action and the configstore getters. Block-type
validation now uses BLOCK_TYPE_ORDER directly, and load_config() drops
the stale quick_add_type_* keys from existing configs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
